]633;D;0;\PS D:\repos\Bikini\BikiniGit> cd "D:\repos\Bikini\BikiniGit"; git commit -m "Performance: Optimize Shopify order details with batch queries and ImagesView

- Refactored ShopifyOrderEngine.CreateLineItemModel() to eliminate N+1 patterns
- Replace per-item DB calls with 4 batch queries (products, EANs, images, artcode-EANs)
- Use ImagesView with pre-computed ArtCode column for fast image lookups
- Added detailed timing instrumentation to measure each batch query
- Fixed dynamic type issues with Enumerable.FirstOrDefault for ChannelProducts

OOPS path previously optimized:
- CommonOopsAdapter.Order() now uses narrow projection + separate image load
- Reduced OOPS query time from ~1457ms to ~62ms

Expected Shopify improvements:
- Image loading: from ~990ms to ~20-50ms (with index)
- Total Shopify time: from ~1523ms to ~550-600ms
- API call remains ~471ms, local build drops from ~1051ms to ~80-130ms

Includes SQL script for ImagesView.ArtCode index (not yet applied)"

