commit df503d1bb180c691de371636f6aecbb985a86cba (HEAD -> dev)
Author: Nick Pearce <nick@planetpearce.com>
Date:   Sat Jun 27 11:41:45 2026 -0700

    Fix SKU parsing and rendering for EAN/UPC values

    - Fixed Sku.Parse() regex patterns to use verbatim strings for proper \d interpretation
    - Updated Sku.Parse() to trim input and preserve OriginalString for invalid SKUs
    - Modified AsSkuString() and AsShortSkuString() to safely render invalid SKUs and EAN values
    - Improved SkuEngine.FromProductAndImage() to handle null productEan.Sku by using EAN directly
    - Removed unreachable Martha's Vineyard fallback code in ShopifyOrderEngine
    - Fixed anonymous type property mismatches in EAN projection (added Id, Code, Description, ProductionFilename)

    These changes eliminate 'INVALID' display for valid UPC/EAN SKUs and remove fragile workarounds.

